    "body": "When all clients enter BFCache, the SharedWorker is no longer actively needed. The User Agent might choose to terminate the worker to prevent resource waste and potential privacy risks associated with keeping it alive indefinitely.\r\n\r\nSince this termination breaks the connections held by the BFCached clients, we must evict them to prevent restoring pages in a broken state. (Ideally, the SharedWorker would be frozen in this case to allow clients to remain in BFCache.)",
    "created_at": "2026-01-20T02:38:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-20T02:38:03Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12086#discussion_r2706551467",
